      "text": "Frequency once per hour\n\nRequirements The kobold dragon spellweaver is adjacent to at least one enemy.\n\n---\n\nEffect The dragon spellweaver creates an illusion of itself in its square and then becomes Invisible (with the effects of a 2nd-rank Invisibility spell) for 1d4+2 rounds. The dragon mage can move up to half its Speed, but it must end its movement in a space that's not adjacent to any enemies.\n\nThis is a 2nd-rank spell that requires a somatic component.",
